  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fbstylia\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/Jc26ntX/PROMO-CODE-BSTYLIA-3.png\" alt=\"PROMO-CODE-BSTYLIA-3\"></span></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\"><strong>使用<strong><u>極限模式</u>&nbsp;</strong>遊玩以獲得最佳體驗。</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/buIIJLdHlfY?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\">趣味全面指南：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/dxvtNZY5vMU?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/PKpimUg.png\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:13.5pt\"><strong>目標：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:14px\">在地獄中生存100天。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:13.5pt\"><strong>任務：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">1... 學習製造槍械、砲塔、載具、複雜機械與機器人士兵。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">2... 招募倖存者加入你的生存基地。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">3... 取得僅存於廢土沙漠中的礦石。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">4... 在第100天的午夜抵禦寄生體大舉入侵。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:13.5pt\"><strong>挑戰：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">1... 逐漸加速的殭屍。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">2... 殭屍具備疊方塊、破壞方塊、召喚同類及感染倖存者的能力。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">3... 棲息於特定生態域的突變生物。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">4... 每10天發動的全面進攻。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">5... 第50天開始出現寄生生物，並隨天數增加而逐漸增多。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">6... 敵對倖存者會一見面就開槍射擊。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">7... 方塊重力系統：若未使用黑曜石、柵欄、石磚、原木或石英方塊支撐，建築有坍塌風險。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:impact, sans-serif\">有疑問嗎？加入我們的Discord。<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fldoh.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fLast_Days_of_Humanity_Wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">或查看模組包維基</a>。<br></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fUjPx5jzd3m\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EuHBB1X.png\" width=\"233\" height=\"97\"></span></a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:impact, sans-serif\">喜歡這個模組包？請在Modded Minecraft Reviews為我們評分。<br></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmmcreviews.com%252fall%252fmodpacks%252flast-days-of-humanity%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/829758/description_2fea3546-1648-454c-a159-1c1c54f00843.png\" width=\"360\" height=\"60\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Bj4cSGd.png\"></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:14px\">問：我該選擇哪種世界類型？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:14px\">答：預設類型。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:14px\">問：我該分配多少記憶體？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:14px\">答：建議分配4-5 GB。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:14px\">問：可以用這個模組包架設伺服器嗎？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:14px\">答：可以，將伺服器包安裝到你的Forge伺服器即可。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:14px\">問：可以用這個模組包進行直播/製作影片嗎？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:14px\">答：可以，請透過連結我的<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dVDPgWTsHbQ\" rel=\"nofollow\">影片</a>或這個CurseForge頁面標註來源。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:14px\">問：我遇到問題了！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:14px\">答：請到我們的<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fUjPx5jzd3m\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a>伺服器尋求技術支援。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:14px\">問：這個模組包有維基頁面嗎？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:14px\">答：有的，我們有正在建設中的維基，包含部分細節與指南：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fldoh.fandom.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://ldoh.fandom.com/</a></span></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong><em>祝你好運。</em></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
